# skill-adapter-skip.list -- skills that get NO .agents/skills/<name>/ discovery adapter.
# Read by gen-skill-adapters.py (beside this file) and by both init validators' parity check.
# One skill directory name per line; '#' starts a comment; an inline comment is the reason.
#
# EMPTY BY DESIGN since v3.0-236's routing remainder: cross-check and cross-check-loop used to
# sit here because they dispatched Claude->GPT unconditionally (same-vendor from a Codex
# session, the v3.0-76 class). They now read the session driver and pass --direction (the
# other vendor) and --requester-vendor (their own), so every bridge skill routes cross-vendor
# from either driver and none is Claude-only. The file stays (an empty list is valid). Do NOT
# add skills here: an adapter makes a skill discoverable, not Claude-runnable, and hiding
# skills from a non-Claude driver is the v3.0-182 mistake this list was a stop-gap for.
